OL,3,GNEWSACall for hour of free parking in
OL,4,AKent town centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign has been launched to provide
OL,7,Fan hour of free parking in town centres
OL,8,Facross Kent.
OL,10,FMedway Council is being asked by two
OL,11,Flocals people to consider a year-long
OL,12,Ftrial of the measure in at least one
OL,13,Fcar park in each of the five towns -
OL,14,FRochester, Chatham, Gillingham, Rainham
OL,15,Fand Strood.
OL,17,FCampaigner Neil Davies said free
OL,18,Fparking "incentivises people to use the
OL,19,Fhigh street," according to the Local
OL,20,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
